# 基础词 Unit 10 短语

## 常考短语

- **current affairs**: 时事 — She keeps up with current affairs. 她关注时事。
- **it is the custom to**: 按照惯例 — It is the custom to shake hands when meeting. 按照惯例见面时握手。
- **the economic cycle**: 经济周期 — The economic cycle goes through boom and bust. 经济周期经历繁荣与萧条。
- **cause/do damage to**: 对…造成损害 — The earthquake caused damage to the buildings. 地震对建筑物造成了损害。
- **a heated debate**: 激烈的辩论 — The issue sparked a heated debate. 这个问题引发了一场激烈的辩论。
- **on the decline**: 在下降中 — Traditional industries are on the decline. 传统行业正在衰退。
- **decorate...with**: 用…装饰 — She decorated the cake with flowers. 她用花装饰了蛋糕。
- **a decrease in**: …的减少 — There has been a decrease in crime. 犯罪有所减少。
- **defend oneself**: 自卫 — Everyone has the right to defend themselves. 每个人都有自卫的权利。
- **define...as**: 把…定义为 — We can define success as achieving one's goals. 我们可以把成功定义为实现目标。
- **a delay in**: …的延误 — There was a delay in the flight. 航班延误了。
- **deliver a speech**: 发表演讲 — The president delivered a speech at the event. 总统在活动上发表了演讲。
- **demand for**: 对…的需求 — There is a high demand for skilled workers. 对技术工人的需求量很大。
- **deny doing sth**: 否认做了某事 — He denied knowing about the plan. 他否认知道这个计划。
- **depend on**: 取决于 — Success depends on hard work. 成功取决于努力。
